release_notes:
We heard your feedback and made Stats easier and more familiar to use.

In this update:
• the latest events appear at the top of History;
• you can quickly switch between day and week views;
• you can view charts and numbers for a selected tracker in the same tab;
• we added new settings for trackers on your Lock Screen;
• dates and times now adapt to your language, region, and system format;
• we fixed blank widgets and a few other issues that could get in the way of everyday parenting.

Thank you for helping us make Sprouty work better for real family life.
